      "writtenOn": "2021-04-02T21:02:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We clear all events from a port on physical disconnect during pe_handle_detach() already. \n\nI think it would make sense for pd_dfp_discovery_init() to clear the discovery flags since it\u0027s also clearing out the discovery information itself, though this would be a cycle or two after the HR flag is set unless we added a call to it earlier in the hard reset process.",
      "parentUuid": "6961b61f_96cafbd7",
      "revId": "7d6270a49176d58671d7742a1013711bd26e5d90",
